{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/3f32ea56831f8fed0a12ec6e13e666ad.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/3f32ea56831f8fed0a12ec6e13e666ad.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/3f32ea56831f8fed0a12ec6e13e666ad.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore atmospheric, detailed locations and enjoy realistic graphics with a carefully crafted environment. Overcome obstacles, climb over barriers, crawl through tight spaces, and scale heights\u2014only the most determined will find their way forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/75762d75b2866eaf0facfc3c49e0cb48.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/75762d75b2866eaf0facfc3c49e0cb48.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/75762d75b2866eaf0facfc3c49e0cb48.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter various puzzles along your path, solving which will be the key to understanding the true nature of these events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/205f8c446bc078b39dc71b8bfd25f13c.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/205f8c446bc078b39dc71b8bfd25f13c.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/205f8c446bc078b39dc71b8bfd25f13c.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a fragile girl and feel the silence of the dark corridors. Explore the shadowy locations hidden around every corner of this once-familiar place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/950a84d65fde3027002a80adeaaff2b5.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/950a84d65fde3027002a80adeaaff2b5.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/950a84d65fde3027002a80adeaaff2b5.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes\u2014it's a familiar ceiling, but something feels off. The silence is too deep. The place that was your home since childhood now feels empty, lifeless... almost unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where is everyone? Why did they leave you behind?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the answers, you\u2019ll have to move forward\u2014through the unsettling darkness, through abandoned hallways hiding unknown dangers. But you won\u2019t give up. Because you have a purpose. And if the world has truly fallen\u2026 then someone has to save it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique close-combat system has been designed to make every encounter intense and dangerous. Even the simplest zombies are now formidable threats. With only a kitchen knife as your main weapon, combat takes place at a dangerously close distance. Experience a classic combat system where every move matters.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953480?t=1762537763","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762537763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/2ef9cbf48ecb556dcd348b8b25fc18f69d1f5c7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762537763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/2ef9cbf48ecb556dcd348b8b25fc18f69d1f5c7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762537763","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages. It contains General Mature Content, and may include Nudity or Sexual Content."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3507560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/3f32ea56831f8fed0a12ec6e13e666ad.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/3f32ea56831f8fed0a12ec6e13e666ad.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/3f32ea56831f8fed0a12ec6e13e666ad.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore atmospheric, detailed locations and enjoy realistic graphics with a carefully crafted environment. Overcome obstacles, climb over barriers, crawl through tight spaces, and scale heights\u2014only the most determined will find their way forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/75762d75b2866eaf0facfc3c49e0cb48.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/75762d75b2866eaf0facfc3c49e0cb48.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/75762d75b2866eaf0facfc3c49e0cb48.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter various puzzles along your path, solving which will be the key to understanding the true nature of these events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/205f8c446bc078b39dc71b8bfd25f13c.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/205f8c446bc078b39dc71b8bfd25f13c.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/205f8c446bc078b39dc71b8bfd25f13c.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a fragile girl and feel the silence of the dark corridors. Explore the shadowy locations hidden around every corner of this once-familiar place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/950a84d65fde3027002a80adeaaff2b5.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/950a84d65fde3027002a80adeaaff2b5.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/950a84d65fde3027002a80adeaaff2b5.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes\u2014it's a familiar ceiling, but something feels off. The silence is too deep. The place that was your home since childhood now feels empty, lifeless... almost unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where is everyone? Why did they leave you behind?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the answers, you\u2019ll have to move forward\u2014through the unsettling darkness, through abandoned hallways hiding unknown dangers. But you won\u2019t give up. Because you have a purpose. And if the world has truly fallen\u2026 then someone has to save it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.poster.avif?t=1762537763\" width=620 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.webm?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/15f78be96664d56e7266a3c83b72e93d.mp4?t=1762537763\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique close-combat system has been designed to make every encounter intense and dangerous. Even the simplest zombies are now formidable threats. With only a kitchen knife as your main weapon, combat takes place at a dangerously close distance. Experience a classic combat system where every move matters.</p>","developers":["Black Rabbit's Tales"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/cd92f270604042effeb1fdd0b92cd217849c124f/header.jpg?t=1762537763","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953480/833950/ebcc16b206b3d0bf918e375e7f3e9b4f4e688416/1750822167/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740351096","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2953480/833950/ebcc16b206b3d0bf918e375e7f3e9b4f4e688416/1750822167/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740351096","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2